    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this data",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Signal type:** Measured. Every panel's ⓘ names its source.\n\n**Site:** `https://gita.atla.in/`. Gita RAG app: FastAPI on EKS (gita-rag-cluster) behind an Application Load Balancer, answering with Amazon Bedrock. No CloudFront or WAF.\n\n**Availability:** Grafana Synthetic Monitoring check `gita.atla.in homepage`, every 5 minutes from 3 probes.\n\n**Traffic:** CloudWatch `AWS/ApplicationELB` in `ap-south-1`, load balancer `app/k8s-gita-gitaapp-62bac50d1f/3f31a5493e811f77` (created by the Kubernetes ingress). Requests include bots.\n\n**AI:** CloudWatch `AWS/Bedrock` in `ap-south-1`: answers from `global.amazon.nova-2-lite-v1:0`, search vectors from `amazon.titan-embed-text-v2:0`. The cost panel multiplies tokens by the per-1K-token prices in the boxes at the top of the page (from the AWS Price List, 2026-09-26; update them if prices change).\n\n**Not shown:** real-visitor data (no RUM on this site); firewall data (no AWS WAF in front of this site); pod CPU, memory and restarts (Container Insights is not enabled); deploy markers; request logs (not collected)."
      },
      "id": 23,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      }
    }
